{"unit_id": "tag:008C:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为连续映射（map），其源空间和目标空间均为拓扑空间（topological spaces）。\n我们将定义直像（pushforward）函子和拉回函子（pullback functors），对预层（presheaves）和层（sheaves）都给出这两种函子。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的一个预层（presheaf），取值于集合（sets）。我们定义<TEXTITOPEN_0001>直像（pushforward）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对<MATH_0004>采用如下规则\n<MATH_0005>\n其中<MATH_0006>为任意开集。\n给定<MATH_0007>，其中所涉集合均为开集，限制映射（map）由下列图表（diagram）的交换性给出\n<MATHSEG_0001>限制，适用于<MATHSEG_0002>\n显然，这定义了一个预层（presheaf），取值于集合（sets）。这一构造显然关于预层（presheaf）<MATH_0008>是函子性的，因此我们得到一个函子（functor）\n<MATH_0009>\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "直像"}, {"source_term": "pullback functors", "target_term": "拉回函子"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "直像"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "开头所设连续映射的名词。"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "连续映射的源空间和目标空间。"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "直像", "context": "开头预告定义的沿连续映射取直像的函子。"}, {"source_term": "pullback functors", "target_term": "拉回函子", "context": "开头与直像函子并列预告定义的函子。"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "开头列举的第一类函子对象。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "开头列举的第二类函子对象。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "用于定义直像的原预层。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "原预层所取的值。"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "直像", "context": "按给定规则定义的原预层的直像。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "由交换图表给出的限制映射。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "用其交换性给出限制映射的图表。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "由给定规则和限制映射定义出的预层。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "所构造出的预层所取的值。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "直像构造对其具有函子性的原预层。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "从直像构造的函子性得到的函子。"}], "notes": []}
